{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026 -What's lonesome?-」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全公演無事完走しました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場に足を運んでくださった皆さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして配信や遠くからパワーを送ってくださっていた皆さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobH9pkQS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobLZ0odY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobVA44sf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よく一緒にぬいぐるみ遊びをしてくれる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobsxiMH7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近私のこと好きですよね？って聞いてきた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobFjP4tw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobcTxUVX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobVfFCe9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うどん脳、ずーっと一緒にいたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寂しいな元気でいてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うぇーーーん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ステージから見る景色の愛おしさを改めて噛み締め直す日々でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひとつとして同じ瞬間のないあの空間で、私は皆さんの熱量にずっと生かされていたのだと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私をステージの上に立たせてくれたのは、他でもない支えてくださっている全ての皆さんです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日からの日々も、皆さんがふとした瞬間に今日のライブの余韻を思い出して"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", 